ical interns, adhering to the National Medical Commission's guidelines issued earlier this year. Several government medical institutions are set to adopt this stipend without delay, marking an important step in supporting foreign medical professionals.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/foreign-medical-graduates-to-get-rs-30000-monthly-stipend-at-five-central-hospitals/articleshow/135998886.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/foreign-medical-graduates-to-get-rs-30000-monthly-stipend-at-five-central-hospitals/articleshow/135998886.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T22:18:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135999378,imgsize-184394.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Stop complaining, look inwards': Congress hits back after PM Modi pulls up India Inc over jobs, salaries]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-complaining-look-inwards-congress-hits-back-after-pm-modi-pulls-up-india-inc-over-jobs-salaries/articleshow/135997732.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135997732.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-complaining-look-inwards-congress-hits-back-after-pm-modi-pulls-up-india-inc-over-jobs-salaries/articleshow/135997732.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-complaining-look-inwards-congress-hits-back-after-pm-modi-pulls-up-india-inc-over-jobs-salaries/articleshow/135997732.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T21:33:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135998211,imgsize-76974.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bihar CM's security 'pushes' Nishant Kumar; JD(U) demands action, police calls it 'human error']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-cms-security-pushes-nishant-kumar-jdu-demands-action-police-calls-it-human-error/articleshow/135996858.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135996858.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-cms-security-pushes-nishant-kumar-jdu-demands-action-police-calls-it-human-error/articleshow/135996858.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bihar-cms-security-pushes-nishant-kumar-jdu-demands-action-police-calls-it-human-error/articleshow/135996858.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T20:49:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135997122,imgsize-745798.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Bring them back': To end terror, Amit Shah pushes to hunt down fugitives hiding abroad]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bring-them-back-to-end-terror-amit-shah-pushes-to-hunt-down-fugitives-hiding-abroad/articleshow/135995196.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135995196.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Amit Shah emphasized the need for international cooperation in the fight against terrorism and organized crime, specifically calling for the return of offenders hiding abroad. He pointed out important milestones, such as the dismantling of the Popular Front of India network. The ongoing two-day Anti-Terror Conference aims to foster intelligence sharing and strengthen investigations, ultimately enhancing inter-agency collaboration to tackle evolving security threats.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bring-them-back-to-end-terror-amit-shah-pushes-to-hunt-down-fugitives-hiding-abroad/articleshow/135995196.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bring-them-back-to-end-terror-amit-shah-pushes-to-hunt-down-fugitives-hiding-abroad/articleshow/135995196.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T19:50:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135995323,imgsize-42250.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mahadev betting app case: Kingpin Saurabh Chandrakar sent to judicial custody till December 2]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mahadev-betting-app-case-kingpin-saurabh-chandrakar-sent-to-judicial-custody-till-december-2/articleshow/135993498.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135993498.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Saurabh Chandrakar has been sent to judicial custody until December 2 by a special court in Raipur. The Enforcement Directorate indicated that it does not require further custodial interrogation at this point. Chandrakar was extradited from Oman earlier this month and produced before the court after a CBI operation. Allegations suggest he operated an illegal online betting network earning significant amounts monthly since 2020.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mahadev-betting-app-case-kingpin-saurabh-chandrakar-sent-to-judicial-custody-till-december-2/articleshow/135993498.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/mahadev-betting-app-case-kingpin-saurabh-chandrakar-sent-to-judicial-custody-till-december-2/articleshow/135993498.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T19:03:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135993656,imgsize-96526.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Himachal minister stokes row with Op Sindoor remarks; BJP says remarks echo Pakistan's language]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/himachal-minister-stokes-row-with-op-sindoor-remarks-bjp-says-remarks-echo-pakistans-language/articleshow/135993539.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135993539.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/himachal-minister-stokes-row-with-op-sindoor-remarks-bjp-says-remarks-echo-pakistans-language/articleshow/135993539.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/himachal-minister-stokes-row-with-op-sindoor-remarks-bjp-says-remarks-echo-pakistans-language/articleshow/135993539.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T19:02:27+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135993650,imgsize-1315761.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘I am now 80’: Siddaramaiah rules out contesting next Karnataka Assembly elections]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-am-now-80-siddaramaiah-rules-out-contesting-next-karnataka-assembly-elections/articleshow/135993317.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135993317.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-am-now-80-siddaramaiah-rules-out-contesting-next-karnataka-assembly-elections/articleshow/135993317.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/i-am-now-80-siddaramaiah-rules-out-contesting-next-karnataka-assembly-elections/articleshow/135993317.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T18:51:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aadrita Halder</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135993351,imgsize-48464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Bhookh itni hai, pet bharta hi nhi': PM Modi pulls up industrialists over lack of jobs, low pay despite tax cuts]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhookh-itni-hai-pet-bharta-hi-nhi-pm-modi-pulls-up-industrialists-over-lack-of-jobs-low-pay-despite-tax-cuts/articleshow/135992230.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135992230.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Prime Minister Narendra Modi on Thursday urged industry leaders to prioritise employee compensation and expand their workforce. He cited governmental efforts to bolster the business climate, such as lowering corporate taxes and simplifying tax regulations. PM Modi also emphasised the importance of maintaining high product standards, and reducing reliance on imported pharmaceuticals to fortify local industries.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhookh-itni-hai-pet-bharta-hi-nhi-pm-modi-pulls-up-industrialists-over-lack-of-jobs-low-pay-despite-tax-cuts/articleshow/135992230.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bhookh-itni-hai-pet-bharta-hi-nhi-pm-modi-pulls-up-industrialists-over-lack-of-jobs-low-pay-despite-tax-cuts/articleshow/135992230.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T18:41:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135993128,imgsize-71760.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Is Asim Munir Pakistan's